# Do not edit Church Admin

Never modify files under:

- `wp-content/plugins/church-admin-premium/`
- `wp-content/plugins/church-admin/`
- `wp-content/plugins/our-church-app-setup/`

Those plugins are updated from upstream. Edits there get wiped on update.

If Church Admin behavior needs a fix or extension, implement it in **`wp-content/plugins/emerson-chapel/`** (hooks, shortcode filters, request-scoped overlays, CSS/JS). Prefer patterns already used there (`do_shortcode_tag`, `pre_do_shortcode_tag`, `init`/`template_redirect`, admin UI under Emerson menus).
